  "id": "2fd1d5dc-d280-5894-a160-55538366b7cc",
  "slug": "skinny-spicy-margarita-recipe-8693903",
  "name": "Skinny Spicy Margarita",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This spicy skinny Margarita is made with fresh orange juice and lime juice and sweetened with agave. Use habanero Tajin and float jalapeno slices to make it even spicier.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Pour Tajin onto a plate. Rub a lime wedge around the rim of a glass, and dip the rim of the glass in Tajin."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Place 3 jalapeno slices into a cocktail shaker and mash well with a cocktail muddler. Add ice to the shaker. Pour in tequila, lime juice, orange juice, and agave syrup; cover and shake until the outside of the shaker has frosted, about 30 seconds. Strain into a chilled glass and garnish with remaining jalapeno slices. Serve immediately."
    }
  ],
